# INFRA-001: Winston Logger Setup

**Status**: Not Started
**Priority**: Medium (Infrastructure)
**Estimated effort**: 30 minutes

## User Need

As a developer/operator, I need structured logging with different levels (debug/info/error) and file output so I can monitor batch execution and debug failures in CI/CD.

## Context

Sets up Winston logger with console + file transports. Critical for debugging async failures in GitHub Actions where console output may be limited.

